  Messages:
  - typeSpeed: 0.05
    currentText: As of 2024, there are over 6.8 billion smartphone users in the world
      and within that population, 6.3% have a phone addiction.
    emotion: 5
  - typeSpeed: 0.05
    currentText: Research published by Virgin Mobile discovered that those billions
      of smartphone users receive 427% more messages and notifications than they
      did a decade ago.
    emotion: 0
  - typeSpeed: 0.05
    currentText: Isn't the internet wonderful? So many people are connected!
    emotion: 0
